OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy this morning
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of drizzle and fog over
OL,7,Fthe hills. Cloud gradually lifting
OL,8,Fthis afternoon to give some sunny
OL,9,Fspells and turning increasingly breezy
OL,10,Facross the south of the region.
OL,11,FMaximum Temperature 9C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry tonight with partly
OL,14,Fcloudy skies. Turning chilly under any
OL,15,Fcloud breaks, perhaps with a touch of
OL,16,Ffrost in the countryside. Minimum
OL,17,FTemperature 0C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
