OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry and bright for many on
OL,6,FChristmas Eve. Turning increasingly
OL,7,Fwindy through the day with a bitter
OL,8,Fwind chill by the afternoon. Maximum
OL,9,FTemperature 6C.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FChristmas Day will be dry with plenty
OL,13,Fof sunshine, feeling cold in the brisk
OL,14,Fwinds. A frosty start on Boxing Day,
OL,15,Fand remaining dry and bright into the
OL,16,Fweekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
